<title>ITALY: Olivetti shares suspended in Milan.</title>
<headline>Olivetti shares suspended in Milan.</headline>
<dateline>MILAN 1997-01-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Ordinary, savings and privileged shares in Italian information technology group Olivetti were suspended on the Milan bourse in early trade, traders said.</p>
<p>Stock market authorities had not yet taken steps to inform the market why the stock had been suspended. Ordinary shares closed at 672.8 lire on Friday.</p>
</text>
